{"title": "Lucky", "pageid": 18732, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lucky", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp/300px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp, /w/images/f/f8/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp/300px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lucky</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. It grants the user 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Luck_Point\" title=\"Luck Point\">Luck Points</a>, which can be can be used to manipulate either their rolls, or an enemy's rolls.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain 3 <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Luck_Point_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luck_Point\" title=\"Luck Point\">Luck Points</a>, which you can use to gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, or to make an enemy reroll their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucky:_Reroll_with_Advantage\" title=\"Lucky: Reroll with Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp/40px-Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp/60px-Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp/80px-Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lucky: Reroll with Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp/40px-Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Lucky_Reroll_with_Advantage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lucky:_Reroll_with_Advantage\" title=\"Lucky: Reroll with Advantage\">Lucky: Reroll with Advantage</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucky:_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die\" title=\"Lucky: Reroll Attacker's Die\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/40px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/60px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/80px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lucky: Reroll Attacker's Die\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp/40px-Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Lucky_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lucky:_Reroll_Attacker%27s_Die\" title=\"Lucky: Reroll Attacker's Die\">Lucky: Reroll Attacker's Die</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lucky_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lucky (Feat)\">Lucky (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Lucky grants a toggleable passive by the same name which, when turned on, provides <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on the character's next Ability Check.</li>\n<li>This feat is one of the few ways to gain Advantage on almost <i>all types</i> of d20 rolls. Player characters in <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty#Honour_mode\" title=\"Difficulty\">Honour Mode</a> may benefit from this feat in situations where failure has particularly unfortunate results or, conversely, success is deemed essential.</li>\n<li>This feat stacks with the racial passive feature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling_Luck\" title=\"Halfling Luck\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/20px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/30px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/40px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halfling Luck\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/20px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling_Luck\" title=\"Halfling Luck\">Halfling Luck</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to the way this passive is granted, it defaults to \"off\" and cannot be toggled \"on\" the very first time it is acquired until <i>after</i> the character has first made an ability check, has used a reaction, has used a short rest, or has taken a long rest.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201120\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1908/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17397/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7966/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1044824/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.666      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   48.666      1 -total\n 26.68%   12.983      8 Template:Icon_text\n 19.87%    9.671     16 Template:Trim\n 16.71%    8.131      4 Template:Icon_link\n 16.39%    7.976      1 Template:R\n 13.87%    6.750      1 Template:SmPass\n  8.46%    4.118      8 Template:Ifempty\n  7.96%    3.875      2 Template:Advantage\n  7.82%    3.804      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18732-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201120 and revision id 388363. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}